{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Color-slurping Invaders!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aliens are invading the garden, and they're here to steal color! Progress through a stained backyard and bring the dreadful aliens back to color.\u200b Section by section the level cleans out and you help in bringing hope back for The Garden! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is a demo for the full game where you get to play a level from the full game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Who are you?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as this funky robot. The name is not important... what you must know is that the robot tries the hardest to protect The Garden\u200b from the mischievous aliens. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Corruption... </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The aliens have corrupted the world by eating away the color.\u00a0There are three variations: A Walker, a Ranged one, and an Escaper. By dashing, you restore back the color in The Garden with your fancy wheel. Don't stay too long in the corrupted area, it may drain you over time! But if you do mess up we made it easy for you- you get restored at the last checkpoint you cleared. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clean The Garden!\u200b</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring the aliens to a Checkpoint to cleanse both them and the corresponding section of The Garden.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One level to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breakable objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Corruption to clean</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642480/extras/mcsticker.png?t=1744052411\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/364248